{#- One home for the empty board's octopus, because the page renders it on load and the pushed board replaces it, so the first review takes it away without a reload. It sits in the head beside the one Set up Intakt link, because the board has no empty block of its own and a second one would add a second title and action (#2067). An idle board, every card in Done, shows the asleep pose instead (#1792). -#}
{%- set pose = board.firstDay ? enum('Intakt\\Core\\Dashboard\\Domain\\MascotPose').Waiting : (board.idle ? enum('Intakt\\Core\\Dashboard\\Domain\\MascotPose').Asleep : null) -%}
{%- if pose -%}
<span class="head-character" id="board-octopus">{{ include('dashboard/components/character.html.twig', {character: pose, size: 144}, with_context = false) }}</span>
{%- else -%}
{#- An empty hidden target stays, so a board that becomes empty again gets its octopus back on the next push (#2437); it has no head-character class, so the head's flex rules leave no gap for it. -#}
<span id="board-octopus" hidden></span>
{%- endif -%}
